    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Use of combination of resistors OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V=IR\"></span> ✓ To show that current in 30 Ω wire is 5.0 A ✓  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{I}=\\frac{2\\times 10^{-7}I_{15}I_{30}}{r}=\\frac{2\\times 10^{-7}\\times 10\\times 5}{0.20}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F=5\\times 10^{-5}\\times 0.25= 1.3\\times 10^{-5}\"></span> N ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>Use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F=BIl\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"45\\times 10^{-6}\\times 10\\times 0.25=1.15\\times 10^{-4} N\"></span> ✓ Concludes that the assumption is not valid ✓</p></section>"
